acklog if issue still exists please drop a message via slack !","2026-01-29T12:21:00.349Z"],["3849325","DSR-4209","DSR",null,"Automation for Jira","We've received your request. Our team is working on two-week sprints. Your request would be evaluated based on legal deadlines and complexity and included in the relevant sprint.\n\nOnce we assess the sprint dates for your request (not later than 2 weeks from the request), the assignee would notify you in this ticket.\n\nPlease check 🌍 [User: Data requests|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/58951] to see if your request needs to be escalated to the Privacy Legal Team. If not, let us know in the ticket to cancel the request.\n\nFor urgent requests (legal deadline for responding to the user is shorter than 2 weeks), please tag Tatsiana Sivukha in this ticket.","2026-01-29T12:21:05.501Z"],["3849326","LSS-60756","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:ff30ea15-dd8e-454c-b884-e2b255723a5f] ! Thanks for your request. Only Ahto’s signature is needed?","2026-01-29T12:21:07.696Z"],["3849328","PFI-825733","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Matched","2026-01-29T12:21:14.534Z"],["3849329","PAW-15257","PAW","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","🤖 AI Analysis: Component label added automatically.\n\nIf you think the component label is incorrect, please remove the suggested label and add the correct one.If you was assigned to this issue, unassign yourself and add the correct label.\n\n","2026-01-29T12:21:22.343Z"],["3849332","PFI-840150","PFI","nigar.alizada@bolt.eu","Nigar Alizada","Hello [~accountid:5c17b23da0376d4fe1e46eb0],\n\nDevice has been unblocked as of now. Let me know if we should block any one of the other device UIDs in this case.\n\nBest Regards,\n\nNigar Alizada ","2026-01-29T12:21:57.253Z"],["3849334","WD-22718","WD","marko.hulak@bolt.eu","Marko Hulak","Hi [~accountid:5ff4436491bb2e0108d1548d] , have you tried to log in via Workday Strategic Sourcing App in Okta menu? \n\nLooks like this.\n\n!image-20260129-122154.png|width=596,alt=\"image-20260129-122154.png\"!\n\n \n","2026-01-29T12:22:04.721Z"],["3849335","FX-3740","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Dmitrii Bokovikov [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1769689313027969]*{color}:\nHi! changed limit to 36 months\n{quote}","2026-01-29T12:22:06.611Z"],["3849339","LSS-60756","LSS","alexandre.lancastre@bolt.eu","Alexandre Lancastre","Hey Aleksandra,\n\nYes, only Ahto’s signature is needed.\n\nThanks,\n\nAlex","2026-01-29T12:22:24.039Z"],["3849341","LSS-62228","LSS","beatrice.grize@bolt.eu","Beatričė Grižė","[~accountid:712020:35a97e3f-8900-4a3a-9057-4ff989d01fe4] no worries, I see that you have already added the necessary email in the initial ticket info 😉 \n\nTo our Legal Ops team: can we please get signatures for this document [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1lLh3AylcwhpjNgN22UD1fRTSOqYGMEyB/edit|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1lLh3AylcwhpjNgN22UD1fRTSOqYGMEyB/edit|smart-link]? \n\nPartner’s email (Valdis Bergs) - [valdis@mobilly.lv|mailto:valdis@mobilly.lv]\n\nThanks a lot! ","2026-01-29T12:22:44.817Z"],["3849342","LSS-62395","LSS","laimonas.jakstys@bolt.eu","Laimonas Jakštys","[^Contract for Recruitment Services_Bolt_Manpower_2026 01 22.docx] _(53 kB)_\n\n[^Personal Data Sharing Addendum (recruitment)_Bolt_Manpower_2026 01 22.docx] _(35 kB)_","2026-01-29T12:22:52.220Z"],["3849343","LSS-62395","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi,\nLaimonas Jakštys has identified that there is a data protection / data privacy consideration for this piece of work. \n\nPlease review the ticket and if needed, then please create a sub-ticket for the Privacy team.","2026-01-29T12:22:53.780Z"],["3849344","PFI-830822","PFI","nazrin.nasibova@bolt.eu","Nazrin Nasibova","Helloo,\n\nI’m assuming we’re referring to the provided fleet, right? → [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/fleet-company/companies/edit/135285?tab=profile|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/fleet-company/companies/edit/135285?tab=profile]\n\n{quote}In that context please note that we got advice from our external advisor and the message is that whenever we cooperate with company, there should be no VAT calculated.{quote}\n\nIn that case, if the fleet is not VAT-liable, the *‘Liable to VAT’* checkbox in the admin company account should be unchecked (this can be updated by the local team). However, this only affects the flow from fleet to rider (ride invoices) or from fleet to Bolt (e.g. branding bonus compensation invoices).\n\n\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-29 at 14.16.20.png|width=288,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-29 at 14.16.20.png\"!\n\n\n\n\n\nRegarding commission invoices from Bolt to the fleet: since Bolt’s commission VAT rate is set to 18%, VAT will be charged on top of the commission invoices.","2026-01-29T12:22:55.784Z"],["3849345","DPX-3475","DPX","tanel.koha@bolt.eu","Tanel Koha","[~accountid:60950a25539c14006ae92e40] Alright, cool - and it doesn’t stop polling, I guess?\n\nBut I suppose that if someone backgrounds the app, they risk that happening anyway.","2026-01-29T12:23:02.967Z"],["3849347","L10N-30991","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-30990](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-30990)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-29T12:23:07.364Z"],["3849348","L10N-30992","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-30990](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-30990)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-29T12:23:08.859Z"],["3849349","L10N-30995","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-30990](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-30990)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-29T12:23:11.167Z"],["3849350","L10N-31000","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 Wh