XXXXXXXX|http://BOLT.EU/X/XXXXXXXXXX]. This would help us identify the exact date and time of the payment.","2026-01-29T12:24:22.639Z"],["3849367","LSS-62200","LSS","beatrice.grize@bolt.eu","Beatričė Grižė","Deadline: 26 February.","2026-01-29T12:24:23.491Z"],["3849369","SRED-1115","SRED","nicolai.antiferov@bolt.eu","Nicolai Antiferov","Done","2026-01-29T12:24:36.194Z"],["3849370","FX-3742","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Dmitrii Bokovikov [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1769689476620569]*{color}:\nRedirected to pint and after to <#C07A21ZJJ4B> [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C07A21ZJJ4B/p1769686020831799]\n\nLinked messages:\n[January 29th, 2026 3:27 AM] dmitrii.bokovikov: Hi! New comment about Sentry failures appears in my team’s closed PR every day but not related to the functionality that was added. [https://github.com/bolteu/fleet-view-portal/pull/1632#issuecomment-3811205474] Does anyone know what can be the reason for it?\n{quote}","2026-01-29T12:24:49.597Z"],["3849371","FPD-1533","FPD","anastasia.serebryannikova@bolt.eu","Nastya Serebryannikova","The PR with the respective changes has been merged: [https://github.com/bolteu/data-science-databricks/pull/809|https://github.com/bolteu/data-science-databricks/pull/809|smart-link] \n\nStill to do in the next tasks:\n\n* change the ingestion configuration to account for the folder structure (the ingested files will be stored under {{/cycle_id/file.parquet}} or {{/cycle_id/city_id/file.parquet}} and not on the top level as previously configured)\n* clarify whether the data is treated as sensitive and whether the access to it is restricted ","2026-01-29T12:24:57.237Z"],["3849372","LSS-62021","LSS","gabriele.kaveckyte@bolt.eu","Gabrielė Kaveckytė","Hey [~accountid:712020:a7dc00bc-9eb8-4c76-ad4a-4fd81a639553] and thanks [~accountid:712020:02e8ad5d-a35d-44b9-b445-6111cdb230dc] for adding me. \n\nFrom a privacy POV, I see no obstacles to proceed with either option proposed by [~accountid:712020:02e8ad5d-a35d-44b9-b445-6111cdb230dc] . \n\nHowever, when collecting evidence/doing outreach to regulators, keep in mind that:\n\n* We can use such evidence (photos shared by users, or user/3rd party reports) to defend ourselves, incl. via consumer protection authorities.\n* We do not need consent from these users to use pictures or reports they shared with us, especially if we don’t intend to share any identifiers (names, contact details, etc.)\n* If we intend to use the details of the persons who reported this to us (e.g. share with VVTAT that on January 29, Gabriele Kaveckyte shared a picture of this SMS), my suggestion is to reach out to the person who reported the issue/sent the picture to us, and inform them about the fact that we’ll share this data in a case.\n** This is important in situations if VVTAT could reach out to the user in question, but this is not mandatory, as we already broadly cover the fact that materials provided by users to us can be use for defense against legal claims/etc.","2026-01-29T12:25:24.578Z"],["3849373","C2-440","C2","martin.luts@bolt.eu","Martin Luts","Controllers to arrive {{2026-02-18}} \n\n!image-20260129-122607.png|width=772,alt=\"image-20260129-122607.png\"!","2026-01-29T12:26:21.616Z"],["3849374","PFI-826411","PFI","jaak.kaljula@bolt.eu","Jaak Kaljula","Hi, sending money to wrong account is a complex case and it is not easy to retrieve it. If mistake was on our end the easiest and fastest solution would be to compensate the driver with the amount they missed. Local team can assist with this compensation","2026-01-29T12:26:30.602Z"],["3849375","WD-22715","WD","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","Hi [~accountid:712020:ff293eea-e5af-4325-9057-8f1a09bd3aa3] ! Could you please try again. Should work now. I was changing the validation yesterday ([https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/WD-22664|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/WD-22664|smart-link] ) and think you were trying to create invoice during my changes. ","2026-01-29T12:26:43.628Z"],["3849376","FPD-1590","FPD","anastasia.serebryannikova@bolt.eu","Nastya Serebryannikova","WIP: [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAR/pages/7468089582/Financial+Planning+Data+Layer|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAR/pages/7468089582/Financial+Planning+Data+Layer|smart-link] ","2026-01-29T12:26:49.715Z"],["3849378","DRX-28045","DRX","ios.ci.robot@bolt.eu","ios.ci robot","2QA: Nothing to test yet","2026-01-29T12:27:00.789Z"],["3849382","PFI-838295","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThe user had a debt of 12€ from this order [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/ride-hailing-order/orders/order/2352193817/324?orderTryId=3028628589|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/ride-hailing-order/orders/order/2352193817/324?orderTryId=3028628589] that was added to the payment, increasing the amount to 17.4€.","2026-01-29T12:28:02.588Z"],["3849385","PFI-840016","PFI","kaisa.kamarik@bolt.eu","Kaisa Kamarik","Sender name matches with the client name. \nThis is not a case of client making a typo in account details, but instead client using their other account details instead.\nPayment is linked to client 4373430. As they have balance on that account, would they like to close that account and return their whole balance instead of moving the funds to the other account?","2026-01-29T12:28:10.169Z"],["3849386","LSS-60604","LSS","jaak.kaljula@bolt.eu","Jaak Kaljula","Partner Payments is not involved here","2026-01-29T12:28:31.796Z"],["3849387","PFI-836379","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Matched","2026-01-29T12:29:22.105Z"],["3849389","BDB-1528","BDB","britt.peet@bolt.eu","Bo Britt Peet","Update after Slack discussion: waiting after partner logo. If we receive a logo today, we’ll provide the print files tomorrow. ","2026-01-29T12:30:08.067Z"],["3849390","PFI-839872","PFI","nazrin.nasibova@bolt.eu","Nazrin Nasibova","Hello, done. will go live on 30.01","2026-01-29T12:30:17.383Z"],["3849391","LSS-60031","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:61693adbbfa2c1006b54680d] ! I have initiated the signature process one more time. The Counterparty should receive it now.","2026-01-29T12:30:23.964Z"],["3849395","RLONE-801","RLONE","christian.johannessen@bolt.eu","Christian Ingdal Johannessen","[~accountid:712020:228a835c-834d-4ca5-b7c2-ebedb4eb0356] Start Date? ","2026-01-29T12:30:44.598Z"],["3849396","ROPSC-573","ROPSC","anneli.tammesson@bolt.eu","Anneli Tammesson","[LT automated audit results|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ORx3_LSJBCovAkvEPpndirNSfBelwZkvh5ictk6jZ2A/edit?gid=193037230#gid=193037230]. 1.3% of active drivers were flagged by the tool. These drivers will be reviewed by local team. ","2026-01-29T12:30:54.022Z"],["3849398","LSS-62395","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Thanks for your ticket! For the lucky ones with access to Flank-supported channels (#legal-agent-) — why not ask your legal AI assistant first on Slack — Flank might already have the answer.","2026-01-29T12:31:07.628Z"],["3849399","LSS-62397","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Thanks for your ticket! For the lucky ones with access to Flank-supported channels (#legal-agent-) — why not ask your legal AI assistant first on Slack — Flank might already have the answer.","2026-01-29T12:31:07.732Z"],["3849400","PFI-838319","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThe debt comes from this order [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/ride-hailing-order/orders/order/2336195214/352?orderTryId=3002125047|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/ride-hailing-order/orders/order/2336195214/352?orderTryId=3002125047] that was charged partially from the card and 16.72 PLN as debt in the Bolt balance.","2026-01-29T12:31:09.848Z"],["3849402","LSS-62020","LSS","mihaela.vatamanu@bolt.eu","Mihaela Vatamanu","hi [~accountid:712020:652fd966-97db-4de3-b20d-d6644848128c] , any chance we get the signed doc today? thanks! ","2026-01-29T12:31:12.296Z"],["3849405","LSS-61847","LSS","aleksandra.kusiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Kusiak","Hi Jolanta, \n\nI work at the Estonian office and I will not be able to pick this up. \nLet me confirm details of the recipient.\n\nThanks, \n","2026-01-29T12:31:41.469Z"],["3849407","PFI-838428","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello Team!\n\nWe can confirm that the refund has been successfully completed and sent to the user's account.\n\nThe refund should appear on the user's statement within *10 business days or more*, depending on their bank's processing times. For PawaPay transactions, the refund should reflect within *48 hours*.\n\nWe understand the delay can be frustrating, and we apologize for any inconvenience this has caused. We recommend the user track the refund with their bank or mobile service provider using the transaction date, time, and amount.\n\nCheers,\nAfiba","2026-01-29T12:31:52.910Z"],["3849408","LSS-62398","LSS","polina.novikova@bolt.eu","Polina Novikova","[^Intel 471 - Customer Agreement_EN_v2021001.pdf] _(361 kB)_","2026-01-29T12:32:02.521Z"],["3849410","PFI-840174","PFI","alina.stepovikova@bolt-outsource.eu","Alina Stepovikova","Got it! Are you able to comment on why this ride didn’t go under work profile?","2026-01-29T12:32:10.233Z"],["3849414","WD-22715","WD","maile.nittim@bolt.eu","Maile Nittim","What a timing 😄 \nYes it’s already working.\n\nThanks!","2026-01-29T12:33:00.666Z"],["3849417","LUX-806","LUX","prasheel.soni@bolt.eu","Prasheel Soni","Some experience in nutshell that we have...","2026-01-29T12:33:29.290Z"],["3849419","LUX-806","LUX",null,"Slack","[Prasheel Soni|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/60fbd5e252162b0068183db8] synced this conversation thread with the Slack thread [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C0A22U1V7A9/p1769688358451919?thread_ts=1769688358.451919&cid=C0A22U1V7A9|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C0A22U1V7A9/p1769688358451919?thread_ts=1769688358.451919&cid=C0A22U1V7A9|smart-link]. Replies in synced threads will automatically update across both Slack and Jira.","2026-01-29T12:33:30.370Z"],["3849420","LUX-806","LUX","ashok.fernandez@bolt.eu","Ashok Fernandez","How did you get on with [@conor.mclaughlin|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/63c11ab62a526608c5506c05]? Did he manage to propose some fixes for the landing page side of things","2026-01-29T12:33:31.193Z"],["3849421","LUX-806","LUX","ashok.fernandez@bolt.eu","Ashok Fernandez","[@prasheel.soni|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/60fbd5e252162b0068183db8] we have this in the backlog for [mobile ux improvements|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/LUX/list?selectedIssue=LUX-805] but this video looks like its something beyond that (the 404 after login) can you please make a task to investigate and fix this?","2026-01-29T12:33:32.027Z"],["3849422","LUX-806","LUX","reinis.paulins@bolt.eu","Reinis Paulins","He haven't yet started to work on this as now, other things he need to cover. But at least we postponed other button that sales wanted to add to form :smile:","2026-01-29T12:33:33.695Z"],["3849423","LUX-806","LUX","prasheel.soni@bolt.eu","Prasheel Soni","{quote}can you please make a task to investigate and fix this?{quote}\n\nYeah sure. This doesn't seem like an improvement, it's rather a bug that needs to be fixed.","2026-01-29T12:33:34.789Z"],["3849425","PFI-840174","PFI","artem.lishchuk@bolt.eu","Artem Lishchuk","As usual, likely some bug occurred. Isn’t worth the time to investigating deeper unless we get multiple such complaints.","2026-01-29T12:33:41.891Z"],["3849430","RNTL-30789","RNTL","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","BACA: Pipeline started.","2026-01-29T12:34:19.104Z"],["3849433","LUX-806","LUX","ashok.fernandez@bolt.eu","Ashok Fernandez","Yep definitely a bug, I'm now wondering if that's been happening more widely and is the reasons we're struggling to convert to booked","2026-01-29T12:34:45.053Z"],["3849435","LSS-62107","LSS","anca.grossu@bolt.eu","Anca-Ioana Grossu","[Here |https://docs.google.com/document/d/1B7dYbQkKIOHscD1ys-Ytu42iI4OCI5m2Cw04kj1z4hw/edit?tab=t.0]is the file in editable format","2026-01-29T12:35:05.389Z"],["3849436","LUX-806","LUX","prasheel.soni@bolt.eu","Prasheel Soni","Created and moved to the top of backlog. Let's bring it in the next sprint or maybe if we have some capacity in this one.","2026-01-29T12:35:06.796Z"],["3849438","HS-29516","HS","aikemaris.muursepp@bolt.eu","Aike-Maris Müürsepp","Waiting for JD.","2026-01-29T12:35:09.812Z"],["3849439","PFI-838470","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThere is a possibility to refund the customer to the card but that would mean refunding the customer twice as the second refund to the card will not cancel that of the Bolt balance. In the end, the customer will receive both refunds and be able to order with their Bolt balance refund. Kindly confirm if we should proceed with the refund.","2026-01-29T12:35:53.475Z"],["3849440","LUX-806","LUX","prasheel.soni@bolt.eu","Prasheel Soni","{quote}is the reasons we're struggling to convert to booked{quote}\n\n[@marek.pagel|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/5fedc5a9a9d03001079cb077] [@oleksii.stavriianov|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/60f6ff1e411fae007085518b], do we have some sort of monitoring for errors?\n\n[@ashok.fernandez|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/712020:f2d0f555-7beb-4a21-b923-60395582fff9], do we have any mixpanel dashboard where I can look at the metrices?","2026-01-29T12:36:03.593Z"],["3849442","LSS-60031","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","[https://app.spotdraft.com/contracts/v2/348115|https://app.spotdraft.com/contracts/v2/348115|smart-link]  ","2026-01-29T12:36:09.583Z"],["3849443","HS-29545","HS","aikemaris.muursepp@bolt.eu","Aike-Maris Müürsepp","Waiting for a new confirmation of studies.","2026-01-29T12:36:11.227Z"],["3849445","PFI-838485","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello Team!\n\nWe can confirm that the refund has been successfully completed and sent to the user's account.\n\nThe refund should appear on the user's statement within *10 business days or more*, depending on their bank's processing times. For PawaPay transactions, the refund should reflect within *48 hours*.\n\nWe understand the delay can be frustrating, and we apologize for any inconvenience this has caused. We recommend the user track the refund with their bank or mobile service provider using the transaction date, time, and amount.\n\nCheers,\nAfiba","2026-01-29T12:36:33.941Z"],["3849446","LSS-62184","LSS","paul.bittan@bolt.eu","Paul Bittan","Thanks [~accountid:712020:8664dd4c-2e90-4dfb-b1bf-6b699c019bd4] - I am working on a few priority matters at the moment. I will take a look at this as soon as I can. Thanks","2026-01-29T12:36:36.032Z"],["3849449","WD-22580","WD","sofja.pomazan@bolt.eu","Sofja Pomazan","Hi, could you please also add _CHE Domestic Purchase of Goods & Services_ and _CHE 8.1% VAT (8.1%)_ for Bolt Support CH Sàrl.\nSpend categories used: _I/C Cost Plus Expense_ and _I/C Support Payment Expense_\n\n\n\n\n\n","2026-01-29T12:36:43.481Z"],["3849450","HS-29542","HS","kristi.vahl@bolt.eu","Kristi Liina Vahl","Hii, contract can be downloaded from [here|https://bolt.box.com/s/0aemvgbvbfsernjqfuv4ucid9gam2oua] ☺️ \n\nBest wishes\n\nKristi Liina","2026-01-29T12:36:52.927Z"],["3849454","WFM-10204","WFM","giovanna.novaes@bolt.eu","Giovanna Sochiarelli da Costa Novaes","request granted ","2026-01-29T12:37:44.079Z"],["3849455","PFI-840257","PFI","daniel.kukucka@bolt-outsource.eu","Daniel Kukucka","!1.png|thumbnail!\n\n!2.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-29T12:37:52.735Z"],["3849458","L10N-31029","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures 