"],["3849701","LSS-58904","LSS","elisabetta.furfarojerusalmy@bolt.eu","Elisabetta Furfaro Jerusalmy","can you kindly grant access and ensure the supplier changes are in redline (can be easily identified vs mine)?\n\nThank you\n\nElisabetta ","2026-01-29T13:09:37.418Z"],["3849703","WFM-10210","WFM","ahmed.othman@bolt.eu","Ahmed Othman","!Screenshot 2026-01-29 170802.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-29T13:10:27.524Z"],["3849706","C2-459","C2","martin.luts@bolt.eu","Martin Luts","[~accountid:712020:82bad36a-3f0b-4609-8bbe-b4ba65e1094e] [~accountid:5fa01d1b903ed30075b38b4d] Can You please approve the price change for this LED indicator?\n\n\n!image-20260129-131057.png|width=772,alt=\"image-20260129-131057.png\"!","2026-01-29T13:11:00.474Z"],["3849708","PFI-838396","PFI","kaisa.kamarik@bolt.eu","Kaisa Kamarik","Sender name matches with the client name. \nThis is not a case of client making a typo in account details, but instead client using their other account details instead.\nPayment is linked to client 7014987. \nShould that account be closed instead and we make a final payout to them?","2026-01-29T13:11:23.877Z"],["3849710","RNTL-30789","RNTL","nurhidayat.thalib@bolt.eu","Nurhidayat Thalib","PR is closed, feature toggle is enough to rever the view back to 2 lines.","2026-01-29T13:11:36.651Z"],["3849712","SREDESK-7477","SREDESK","kourosh.tafreshi@bolt.eu","Kourosh Tafreshi","Hello [~accountid:5b711354816d1805baacaae9] \n\nWe grant AWS access based on either a person’s team or their Organization ID from Workday.\nAccording to Workday, your Organization ID SUP4.1 belongs to the Management team, which typically has access limited to billing and cost-related views in most AWS accounts.\n\nThat said, if you could please elaborate on why you need this access, what it’s for, or at least which one of your coworkers already have the same access you need, I can grant you the appropriate access much faster.","2026-01-29T13:11:44.144Z"],["3849713","UXA-2187","UXA",null,"Automation for Jira","*Konrad Powązka* has updated the *Epic Link* on UXA-2255 so the total Story Points on this Epic has been adjusted to *1.0*.","2026-01-29T13:11:48.144Z"],["3849714","PFI-838394","PFI","kaisa.kamarik@bolt.eu","Kaisa Kamarik","Sender name matches with the client name. \nThis is not a case of client making a typo in account details, but instead client using their other account details instead.\nPayment is linked to client 7014987. \nShould that account be closed instead and we make a final payout to them?","2026-01-29T13:11:49.580Z"],["3849715","CSCC-52","CSCC","margarita.hobo@bolt.eu","Margarita Hobo","As per agreement with Cheila Aniceto, the training update will be paused. The reasons:\n1) Some of the processes are not set in stone yet and are being under development\n2) We do not expect any new joiners anytime soon, so for now, this task will bring low impact. \n3) We will re-asses once Cheila has gone through existing Lux Onboarding courses and will suggest the changes and improvements she would like to see in the training. ","2026-01-29T13:11:52.484Z"],["3849716","WDFT-3569","WDFT","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","[~accountid:624d3e6a45ece00069cdb4e5] , [~accountid:712020:2261816b-1a2b-4b75-b1dc-d5fce431ad15]  is assigned directly to BG001 as accountant, so she is not effected by move of BG001 to Region 6, she still has access. \n\nRemoved accountant role for HR001 from [~accountid:712020:2b04881a-4ca8-40cb-9a35-a008b9853ec0]  and added this role to [~accountid:712020:c6829626-18d0-4d73-9974-74d1569b4bdf] ","2026-01-29T13:11:58.830Z"],["3849719","SAI-1406","SAI","david.tomes@bolt.eu","David Tomeš","thank you guys! if you are able to pick this up in february, please summon [@fatmakhanim.mammadova|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/712020:acac9ebc-221a-4fd9-a729-81559cb66520] here - she has all the knowledge around suspensions in Saudi Arabia :blob_thanks:","2026-01-29T13:12:17.636Z"],["3849721","CSDT-976","CSDT","boris.pavlov@bolt.eu","Boris Pavlov","* Version 1 prototype is ready and sent for review to cs data and tw data teams: [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C069Y8DNN7L/p1769692700421379|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C069Y8DNN7L/p1769692700421379|smart-link] \n* Samples collected and reviewed here: [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1td8sKRKt1axueEB1a2TF3ZD1h8EaAb5M7zW9wIFLeL4/edit?gid=0#gid=0|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1td8sKRKt1axueEB1a2TF3ZD1h8EaAb5M7zW9wIFLeL4/edit?gid=0#gid=0|smart-link] \n* Will work on V2-V4 after this work is reviewed","2026-01-29T13:12:37.365Z"],["3849722","FDBT-4844","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","DAG commerce_finance_pipeline_bank_payments fails on 2026-01-28 02:30:00+00:00.\n\n        Exception:\n        Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 282, in _run_raw_task\n    TaskInstance._execute_task_with_callbacks(\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 3184, in _execute_task_with_callbacks\n    result = self._execute_task(context, task_orig)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 3208, in _execute_task\n    return _execute_task(self, context, task_orig)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 776, in _execute_task\n    result = _execute_callable(context=context, **execute_callable_kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 742, in _execute_callable\n    return ExecutionCallableRunner(\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/utils/operator_helpers.py\", line 252, in run\n    return self.func(*args, **kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/baseoperator.py\", line 1816, in resume_execution\n    return execute_callable(context)\n  File \"/home/airflow