n source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-31067](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-31067)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-30T08:23:09.370Z"],["3851540","PFI-839599","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nWe have forwarded the refund request to the payment service provider and will be initiated shortly. Once the refund done, it should reflect in the user’s account within 48 hours. ","2026-01-30T08:23:29.537Z"],["3851541","PFI-839577","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nWe have forwarded the refund request to the payment service provider and will be initiated shortly. Once the refund done, it should reflect in the user’s account within 48 hours. ","2026-01-30T08:23:59.198Z"],["3851542","FDBT-4883","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","DAG commerce_finance_data_integration_silverflow fails on 2026-01-29 02:00:00+00:00.\n\n        Exception:\n        Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 282, in _run_raw_task\n    TaskInstance._execute_task_with_callbacks(\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 3184, in _execute_task_with_callbacks\n    result = self._execute_task(context, task_orig)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 3208, in _execute_task\n    return _execute_task(self, context, task_orig)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 771, in _execute_task\n    result = _execute_callable(context=context, **execute_callable_kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 742, in _execute_callable\n    return ExecutionCallableRunner(\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/utils/operator_helpers.py\", line 252, in run\n    return self.func(*args, **kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/baseoperator.py\", line 424, in wrapper\n    return func(self, *args, **kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/bolt/airflow/operators/aws/ecr_docker_operator.py\", line 139, in execute\n    self.runtime_strategy.wait_until_done(self.container_id)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/bolt/airflow/docker/batch/aws_batch_container_runtime_strategy.py\", line 215, in wait_until_done\n    raise AirflowException(f\"Batch job status is {current_job.status}, failing downstream task\")\nairflow.exceptions.AirflowException: Batch job status is FAILED, failing downstream task\n\n        Log URL: https://airflow-commerce.data.boltint.net/dags/commerce_finance_data_integration_silverflow/grid?dag_run_id=scheduled__2026-01-29T02%3A00%3A00%2B00%3A00&task_id=silverflow_reconciliation_details_raw_task&base_date=2026-01-29T02%3A00%3A00.000000%2B0000&tab=logs\n        ","2026-01-30T08:24:02.246Z"],["3851544","PFI-840623","PFI","lucian.andrei@bolt.eu","Lucian Andrei","[^5992600015.pdf]","2026-01-30T08:25:11.348Z"],["3851545","PFI-840623","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nBusiness ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=282576311\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-30T08:25:13.695Z"],["3851546","LSS-59055","LSS","philippine.huret@bolt.eu","Philippine Huret","Hi [~accountid:5f5f26b5f4571b006a51732b], please could you reply with the following:\n\n \n\nBonjour Monsieur Michel,\n\nSuite à votre demande concernant Monsieur Arnaud FERON, nous vous informons que, conformément à nos procédures internes, une période de 6 mois à compter de la date du blocage, le 2 septembre 2025 dans le cas de Monsieur Arnaud FERON, doit s’écouler avant que la demande de réactivation puisse être examinée.\n\nNous vous invitons à revenir vers nous à compter du 2 mars 2026 pour effectuer la demande de réactivation du compte.\n\nConformément au cadre applicable au dialogue social dans le secteur des VTC, nous vous informons que les coordonnées des organisations représentatives des travailleurs indépendants figurent ci-dessous, si votre client souhaite les contacter.\n\n|h2. [+*Coordonnées des organisations représentatives des travailleurs indépendants du secteur des VTC*+|https://www.arpe.gouv.fr/les-organisations-representatives-des-travailleurs-independants/#h2-2]|\n|h3. *ACIL : Association des Chauffeurs Indépendants Lyonnais*\n* [Site internet |http://www.acilvtclyon.fr/]\n* Coordonnées *:* [acilvtclyon@gmail.com|https://www.arpe.gouv.fr/les-organisations-representatives-des-travailleurs-independants/acilvtclyon@gmail.com]|\n|h3. *FO : Force Ouvrière*\n* [Site internet |https://www.force-ouvriere.fr/travailleurs-des-plateformes-avec-fo-pour-gagner-des-droits]\n* Coordonnées *:* [+sg@force-ouvriere.fr+|mailto:sg@force-ouvriere.fr] |\n|h3. *UD - VTC SUD : Union des VTC 06/83*\n* Page [Facebook|https://www.facebook.com/p/UNION-DES-VTC-0683-100088991093162/] \n* Coordonnées :  [+uniondesvtc0683@gmail.com+|mailto:uniondesvtc0683@gmail.com] \n* Représentants :  \n** Houari BEN ALI | 06 01 64 77 79  | [+houari3120@live.fr+|mailto:houari3120@live.fr]  \n** Sabrina SABENA | 07 68 25 41 16 | [+lilisab1930@gmail.com+|mailto:lilisab1930@gmail.com]  \n** Florian RUBELI MAROVELLI | 06 06 44 38 09 | [+florian.rubeli@gmail.com+|mailto:florian.rubeli@gmail.com] |\n|h3. *UNION - Indépendants*\n* [Site internet |https://www.union-independants.fr/]\n* Coordonnées : [contact@union-independants.fr|mailto:contact@union-independants.fr] \n* Représentants : \n** Adel DE SOUSA | [+syndic.occitanie@gmail.com+|mailto:syndic.occitanie@gmail.com]\n** li LEMMOUCHI | [+ali197393@hotmail.com+|mailto:ali197393@hotmail.com]\n** Fabian TOSOLINI | [+fabian@union-independants.fr+|mailto:fabian@union-independants.fr]  |\n\nCordialement,\n\n[Nom & Fonction]\n\nBolt\n\n \n\ncc. [~accountid:5d4d47a42be2120ce3e60fca]","2026-01-30T08:25:17.896Z"],["3851548","GREAT-1004","GREAT","dmitry.aflitonov@bolt.eu","Dmitry Aflitonov","It’s correct. It should be either 1 or 2. 0 means that always no snippet will be shown.","2026-01-30T08:25:34.552Z"],["3851550","PAW-15278","PAW","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","🤖 Auto-closed: PR was approved by @bolt-juri-gavshin\n\nPR: https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/pull/162332\nStatus: open\nAuto-closed at: 2026-01-30 08:25:49 UTC\n\nIf this ticket was closed incorrectly, you can reopen it manually.","2026-01-30T08:25:50.052Z"],["3851552","PAW-15230","PAW","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","🤖 Auto-closed: PR was approved by @bolt-juri-gavshin\n\nPR: https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/pull/162284\nStatus: open\nAuto-closed at: 2026-01-30 08:26:17 UTC\n\nIf this ticket was closed incorrectly, you can reopen it manually.","2026-01-30T08:26:17.578Z"],["3851554","MARTECH3-1473","MARTECH3","prakhar.saini@bolt.eu","Prakhar Saini","*Update 02/02*\n\nHad another session on 26/01 to cover CLS experiments. Also assigned Meta and Google CLS experiments to analyze using the helper Google sheet. \n\nRecording:\n[https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wCdBMN4BGvxb6QsJnv00WF-j8LFmdDVz/view|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wCdBMN4BGvxb6QsJnv00WF-j8LFmdDVz/view|smart-link] \n\n*Next Steps*\n\nFinish experiment KT by covering v2 framework. ","2026-01-30T08:26:28.588Z"],["3851555","PFI-838956","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nThere was a temporary technical issue with the payment service provider which caused the payments to fail. We have now cancelled the payments and for orders that were completed, a balance debt will be created to the user's account and they will be able to pay it with their next order.","2026-01-30T08:26:32.005Z"],["3851557","CSP-290","CSP","michal.bielecki@bolt.eu","Michał Bielecki","26W05: Implementation on track to finalize alerting rules management till end of 26W06. We plan to iterate with actual alert evaluation and displaying the information about alerts in Queue Overview and RTM dashboard. Some topics are pending clarification and grooming so cannot provide any ETA yet. My rough estimate is end of 26W08 to finalize Alerting and Thresholds.","2026-01-30T08:27:15.498Z"],["3851558","BDB-1461","BDB","amal.bahar@bolt.eu","Amal Bahar","This was covered offline, but for future bibi & Amal reference: we’ll launch Hopp Plus first and monitor adoption. If adoption is below target in the first -two- couple of weeks, we’ll use OOH as a growth lever.\n\nIn the meantime, would be great to complete any OOH prep that can be done without a media plan, so if we decide to proceed, we only need to reformat sizes 🤘 ","2026-01-30T08:27:32.718Z"],["3851560","PFI-829457","PFI","kaisa.kamarik@bolt.eu","Kaisa Kamarik","Hey, could you clarify your expectation for us, what needs to happen?\nDo we need to refund the payment?\nIf this is regarding balance adjustments, then please turn to billing team. ","2026-01-30T08:27:48.230Z"],["3851562","LSS-62434","LSS","gabriele.kaveckyte@bolt.eu","Gabrielė Kaveckytė","Hey [~accountid:712020:47b28358-3e16-42e1-98f8-60975dca1fc0] , as this is not a privacy question, I am re-assigning this one to [~accountid:712020:548c71a6-d1f4-404d-9c5e-482bc0de371a] from Legal.","2026-01-30T08:28:47.614Z"],["3851563","PFI-840458","PFI","afiba.toulassi@bolt.eu","Afiba Marylise-Lolita Toulassi","Hello,\n\nWe have forwarded the refund request to the payment service provider and will be initiated shortly. Once the refund done, it should reflect in the user’s account within 48 hours. ","2026-01-30T08:29:24.454Z"],["3851568","LSS-61674","LSS","philippine.huret@bolt.eu","Philippine Huret"," Hi [~accountid:5f5f26b5f4571b006a51732b], please could you reply with the following:\n\n \n\nBonjour Monsieur Michel,\n\nSuite à votre demande concernant Monsieur Hicham SLIMANI, nous vous informons que, conformément à nos procédures internes, une période de 6 mois à compter de la date du blocage, le 28 août 2025 dans le cas de Monsieur Hicham SLIMANI, doit s’écouler avant que la demande de réactivation puisse être examinée.\n\nNous vous invitons à revenir vers nous à compter du 28 février 2026 pour effectuer la demande de réactivation du compte.\n\nConformément au cadre applicable au dialogue social dans le secteur des VTC, nous vous informons que les coordonnées des organisations représentatives des travailleurs indépendants figurent ci-dessous, si votre client souhaite les contacter.\n\n|h2. [+*Coordonnées des organisations représentatives des travailleurs indépendants du secteur des VTC*+|https://www.arpe.gouv.fr/les-organisations-representatives-des-travailleurs-independants/#h2-2]|\n|h3. *ACIL : Association des Chauffeurs Indépendants Lyonnais*\n* [Site internet |http://www.acilvtclyon.fr/]\n* Coordonnées *:* [acilvtclyon@gmail.com|https://www.arpe.gouv.fr/les-organisations-representatives-des-travailleurs-independants/acilvtclyon@gmail.com]|\n|h3. *FO : Force Ouvrière*\n* [Site internet |https://www.force-ouvriere.fr/travailleurs-des-plateformes-avec-fo-pour-gagner-des-droits]\n* Coordonnées *:* [+sg@force-ouvriere.fr+|mailto:sg@force-ouvriere.fr] |\n|h3. *UD - VTC SUD : Union des VTC 06/83*\n* Page [Facebook|https://www.facebook.com/p/UNION-DES-VTC-0683-100088991093162/] \n* Coordonnées :  [+uniondesvtc0683@gmail.com+|mailto:uniondesvtc0683@gmail.com] \n* Représentants :  \n** Houari BEN ALI | 06 01 64 77 79  | [+houari3120@live.fr+|mailto:houari3120@live.fr]  \n** Sabrina SABENA | 07 68 25 41 