 admin panel pages for get, create, update and list for ads bundles\n\n_Scope change:_ \n\n# Designs review happened this week.\n# After the designs are locked, I will create tasks for it and give the proper estimations/timelines for this project","2026-01-30T12:23:03.942Z"],["3852738","DO-5775","DO","pedro.paiva@bolt.eu","Pedro Paiva","The databricks SP was already created.\nJust the looker side is missing. But sure, I guess we can wait till next week","2026-01-30T12:23:19.588Z"],["3852739","PFI-840733","PFI","onyinye.osuagwu@bolt.eu","Onyinyechukwu Osuagwu","!Screenshot 2026-01-30 at 13.23.05.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-30T12:23:31.395Z"],["3852740","GREAT-1007","GREAT","dmitry.aflitonov@bolt.eu","Dmitry Aflitonov","It is Snippet V3, correct? With a disabled title?","202